{"title":"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca8d0ec6dc74f13176a38469882c5e79894f7409.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/8/d98d2ed450f84fb3b2599ba598ed5e6e7a69ecfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />, and the altitude to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the sum of the two possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/2/1d20ecb0f4235fe2d69eb2216c1bc4f60c84fa96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 15\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 17\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 18\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be the foot of the altitude to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a190479975642cc37d54e7f683adac5767ab2b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = \\sqrt {13^2 - 12^2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"178\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a316d4aa309061065f447301645f68255c1fc992.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC = \\sqrt {15^2 - 12^2} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"178\" height=\"21\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95c92013847b0c7d5ed1e47138e864652b9bfc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = BD + BC = 5 + 9 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"244\" height=\"16\" />. Otherwise, assume that the triangle is obtuse at angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/8/018c7c616e0b7a272a77970bc3df6e55d2f0be9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = DC - BD = 9 -5 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"233\" height=\"13\" />.  The sum of the two possible values is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/2/a923faead2cb21f4041dcf99e59c96d6d3aef400.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 + 4 = \\boxed{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B\">2009 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AM